/* Hand-built Hard mode teams for Hoenn's big fights.
   Each team has a plan (weather, Trick Room, redirection, setup sweepers)
   so the AI plays to it. Levels sit a little above the originals; with
   level caps on, the cap for each badge matches the leader's top level.
   Only the fields listed here change; name, picture and music stay. */

